@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-01, FR-02
' source:       frontend/focus-flow/src/components/LoginPage.jsx, backend/src/services/auth.service.js, backend/src/services/loginThrottle.service.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依目前登入、角色驗證與暫時鎖定路徑重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title 一般登入與帳號鎖定循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "使用者" as User
participant "LoginPage" as LoginPage
participant "apiFetch()" as ApiClient
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "AuthService" as AuthService
participant "LoginThrottleService" as LoginThrottle
database "User model" as UserModel
participant "bcryptjs" as Bcrypt
participant "jsonwebtoken" as Jwt

User -> LoginPage : 選擇角色並提交 Email／密碼
LoginPage -> ApiClient : POST /api/v1/auth/login
ApiClient -> AuthController : login(req.body)
AuthController -> AuthService : login({ email, password, role })
AuthService -> AuthService : 驗證 role 屬於 student／teacher／admin
AuthService -> LoginThrottle : assertLoginAllowed(email)

alt 尚在鎖定期間
  LoginThrottle --> AuthService : throw TOO_MANY_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS
  AuthService --> AuthController : 429 + retryAfterSec
  AuthController --> ApiClient : 錯誤回應
  ApiClient --> LoginPage : 顯示稍後再試
else 允許嘗試
  AuthService -> UserModel : findOne({ email })
  UserModel --> AuthService : User／null
  alt 帳號不存在或密碼錯誤
    AuthService -> Bcrypt : compare(password, passwordHash)
    Bcrypt --> AuthService : false
    AuthService -> LoginThrottle : buildLoginFailureError(email)
    LoginThrottle --> AuthService : 剩餘次數或鎖定錯誤
    AuthService --> AuthController : 401／429
    AuthController --> LoginPage : 顯示剩餘次數或鎖定訊息
  else 密碼正確
    AuthService -> Bcrypt : compare(password, passwordHash)
    Bcrypt --> AuthService : true
    AuthService -> LoginThrottle : recordLoginSuccess(email)
    AuthService -> AuthService : 檢查 isActive 與所選 role
    alt 帳號停用或角色不符
      AuthService --> AuthController : 403 USER_INACTIVE／ROLE_MISMATCH
      AuthController --> LoginPage : 拒絕登入
    else 驗證通過
      AuthService -> Jwt : sign({ sub }, JWT_SECRET)
      Jwt --> AuthService : JWT
      AuthService -> AuthService : recordUsage(LOGIN)
      AuthService --> AuthController : { token, public user }
      AuthController --> ApiClient : 200 Login successful
      ApiClient --> LoginPage : 儲存 ff_token／ff_user
      LoginPage --> User : 進入角色對應 Dashboard
    end
  end
end

note over AuthService,LoginThrottle
  登入失敗計數以正規化 Email 為鍵，狀態保存在單一 backend process 記憶體；
  backend 重啟後會歸零。學生可自助註冊，教師與管理員帳號須由管理流程建立。
end note

@enduml
